Z||000005||mbramble||06-05-2001||09:03 PM||||When I was growing up in middle GA, most  carbonated drinks were just called "Coke"!!  We had orange coke, grape coke, and plain old coke.  That was the days before the clear colas and about the only thing you would routinely see was Pepsi, Dr. Pepper, Coke and Nehi grape and orange.  "Coke" worked for everything.<P>When that went out of fashion, soda was what they were called.  We always thought that anyone who said pop must be from up north... <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">||||reg||1
Z||000006||Bluebottlejunky||06-05-2001||09:10 PM||||hmmm,  I say POP, but I do agree Soda sounds more smart nerdy hehehehe  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>------------------<BR>Hello, My name is Mike and I am addicted too fiero's...PLEASE dont help me.<BR>85'GT 4sp<BR>AIM: Fierofanatic2001||||reg||1
