Z||000013||Ronnie||06-05-2001||10:41 PM||||If you'll all notice, all the pop and soda people are from "up north", lol. Down on the farm in Ga., you ask for the 'real thing". If you want coke , ask for Coke, if you'd like a Pepsi , ask for Pepsi , and so on , and so on, ........ HeHe<BR>If you ask for a soda or pop, what do you get?????||||reg||10
