Z||000022||Songman||06-06-2001||01:29 AM||||I'm just gonna copy my post from the other section here instead of retyping it...<BR>---<P>I'm from the south.. no matter what it is, if it is a soft drink and comes in a can it is a Coke! As in "I'm going to get a Coke, you want one?" Then if they say yes, you ask what kind... Maybe it is because Coke was invented down here. <P>"It may be a law, I don't know..." <I>James Gregory</I><P>------------------<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/songman_1.gif"> <BR><A HREF="http://members.home.com/tnfieros" TARGET=_blank>Tennessee Fiero Owners</A>||||reg||1
